  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Season bass fillets with salt and pepper.",
    "3. Grill bass for 4-5 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "4. In a large skillet, heat coconut oil over medium-high heat.",
    "5. Add Thai red curry paste and cook for 1-2 minutes, until fragrant.",
    "6. Add noodles to the skillet and cook for 2-3 minutes, until slightly browned.",
    "7. Stir in Thai basil and cook for an additional minute.",
    "8. Serve grilled bass on top of the noodle stir fry.",
    "9. Garnish with additional Thai basil, if desired.",
